			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"$M(x\\,;\\,y)$ appartient à la droite si et seulement si $\\overrightarrow{AM}\\cdot\\vec{n}=0$, avec $\\overrightarrow{AM}\\begin{pmatrix}x{{if:mx0>0|+{{eval:mx0}}}}{{if:mx0< 0|{{eval:mx0}}}}\\\\y{{if:my0>0|+{{eval:my0}}}}{{if:my0< 0|{{eval:my0}}}}\\end{pmatrix}$.",
					"$\\overrightarrow{AM}\\cdot\\vec{n}={{if:a==1|(x{{if:mx0>0|+{{eval:mx0}}}}{{if:mx0< 0|{{eval:mx0}}}})}}{{if:a==-1|-(x{{if:mx0>0|+{{eval:mx0}}}}{{if:mx0< 0|{{eval:mx0}}}})}}{{if:a>1|{{eval:a}}(x{{if:mx0>0|+{{eval:mx0}}}}{{if:mx0< 0|{{eval:mx0}}}})}}{{if:a< -1|{{eval:a}}(x{{if:mx0>0|+{{eval:mx0}}}}{{if:mx0< 0|{{eval:mx0}}}})}}{{if:b==1|+(y{{if:my0>0|+{{eval:my0}}}}{{if:my0< 0|{{eval:my0}}}})}}{{if:b==-1|-(y{{if:my0>0|+{{eval:my0}}}}{{if:my0< 0|{{eval:my0}}}})}}{{if:b>1|+{{eval:b}}(y{{if:my0>0|+{{eval:my0}}}}{{if:my0< 0|{{eval:my0}}}})}}{{if:b< -1|{{eval:b}}(y{{if:my0>0|+{{eval:my0}}}}{{if:my0< 0|{{eval:my0}}}})}}={{if:a==1|x}}{{if:a==-1|-x}}{{if:a>1|{{eval:a}}x}}{{if:a< -1|{{eval:a}}x}}{{if:b==1|+y}}{{if:b==-1|-y}}{{if:b>1|+{{eval:b}}y}}{{if:b< -1|{{eval:b}}y}}{{if:c>0|+{{eval:c}}}}{{if:c< 0|{{eval:c}}}}$",
					"Une équation cartésienne de $d$ est ${{eval:a}}x{{if:b==1|+y}}{{if:b==-1|-y}}{{if:b>1|+{{eval:b}}y}}{{if:b< -1|{{eval:b}}y}}{{if:c>0|+{{eval:c}}}}{{if:c< 0|{{eval:c}}}}=0$, soit ${{if:b==1|y}}{{if:b==-1|-y}}{{if:b>1|{{eval:b}}y}}{{if:b< -1|{{eval:b}}y}}={{if:ma==1|x}}{{if:ma==-1|-x}}{{if:ma>1|{{eval:ma}}x}}{{if:ma< -1|{{eval:ma}}x}}{{if:mc>0|+{{eval:mc}}}}{{if:mc< 0|{{eval:mc}}}}$.",
